# HTTPS

HTTPS = HTTP + TLS/SSL Encryption

Port:

```text
443
```
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## HTTPS Communication

```text
Browser
    ↓
TLS Handshake
    ↓
Certificate Validation
    ↓
Encrypted Communication
```

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## TLS Handshake Simplified

```text
Client Hello
      ↓
Server Hello
      ↓
Certificate
      ↓
Key Exchange
      ↓
Secure Session
```
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Why HTTPS Matters

Without HTTPS:Username,Password ,Cookie can be intercepted.

With HTTPS:Encrypted Data cannot be easily read.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

## HTTPS Security Attacks

| Attack            | Description           |
| ----------------- | --------------------- |
| SSL Stripping     | Downgrade HTTPS       |
| MITM              | Intercept traffic     |
| Fake Certificates | Impersonation         |
| TLS Downgrade     | Force weak encryption |
